    {
      "id": 27,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -580,
        0
      ],
      "size": [
        540,
        860
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 26,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.34.0"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## HOW TO: HunyuanVideo 1.5 (8.3B) Fast I2V\n\n### 1. Pre-configured for 480p Step-Distilled (Fast on 3090!)\n- **Model:** `hunyuanvideo1.5_480p_i2v_step_distilled_fp16.safetensors` with `weight_dtype = fp8_e4m3fn` (~9 GB VRAM!).\n- **Steps:** `12` (8\u201312 recommended by Tencent) | **CFG:** `1.0` | **Shift:** `7.0` | **Sampler:** `euler` / `simple`.\n- **Want 720p Base instead?** Swap Node 1 to `hunyuanvideo1.5_720p_i2v_fp16.safetensors`, set `WIDTH = 1280`, `HEIGHT = 720`, `CFG = 6.0`, `steps = 20` (up to 50 for max quality), `Shift = 7.0`.\n\n### 2. How to change LENGTH & RESOLUTION\n- **Duration:** Edit `Duration in seconds` (Group 2). Runs at **24 fps**, snaps to `4n + 1` frames (`3s=73`, `4s=97`, **`5s=121`**, max ~`129`).\n- **Resolution (must be \u00f7 16):**\n  - 480p distilled: **`848\u00d7480`** (16:9), `480\u00d7848` (9:16), `640\u00d7640` (1:1)\n  - 720p base: `1280\u00d7720` (16:9), `720\u00d71280` (9:16)\n\n### 3. Audio (Video-Only Model)\n- HunyuanVideo 1.5 generates **video only**.\n- To mux your own music/SFX/voiceover directly into the MP4: **Ctrl+B** `LoadAudio` + `TrimAudioDuration` in Group 3 and select your audio file (or add sound in DaVinci Resolve / `ComfyUI-MMAudio`).\n- **License note:** Tencent Hunyuan Community License has regional commercial restrictions (EU, UK, South Korea); check before commercial release.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## HOW TO: HunyuanVideo 1.5 (8.3B) Fast I2V\n\n### 1. Pre-configured for 480p Step-Distilled (Fast on 3090!)\n- **Model:** `hunyuanvideo1.5_480p_i2v_step_distilled_fp16.safetensors` with `weight_dtype = fp8_e4m3fn` (~9 GB VRAM!).\n- **Steps:** `12` (8\u201312 recommended by Tencent) | **CFG:** `1.0` | **Shift:** `7.0` | **Sampler:** `euler` / `simple`.\n- **Want 720p Base instead?** Swap Node 1 to `hunyuanvideo1.5_720p_i2v_fp16.safetensors`, set `WIDTH = 1280`, `HEIGHT = 720`, `CFG = 6.0`, `steps = 20` (up to 50 for max quality), `Shift = 7.0`.\n\n### 2. How to change LENGTH & RESOLUTION\n- **Duration:** Edit `Duration in seconds` (Group 2). Runs at **24 fps**, snaps to `4n + 1` frames (`3s=73`, `4s=97`, **`5s=121`**, max ~`129`).\n- **Resolution (must be \u00f7 16):**\n  - 480p distilled: **`848\u00d7480`** (16:9), `480\u00d7848` (9:16), `640\u00d7640` (1:1)\n  - 720p base: `1280\u00d7720` (16:9), `720\u00d71280` (9:16)\n\n### 3. Audio (Video-Only Model)\n- HunyuanVideo 1.5 generates **video only**.\n- To mux your own music/SFX/voiceover directly into the MP4: **Ctrl+B** `LoadAudio` + `TrimAudioDuration` in Group 3 and select your audio file (or add sound in DaVinci Resolve / `ComfyUI-MMAudio`).\n- **License note:** Tencent Hunyuan Community License has regional commercial restrictions (EU, UK, South Korea); check before commercial release.\n"
      },
      "title": "HOW TO: Length, Resolution & Distilled vs 720p",
      "color": "#233",
      "bgcolor": "#355"
    },
