      "widgets_values": [
        "## Model Downloads (HunyuanVideo 1.5 8.3B)\n\nFrom [`Comfy-Org/HunyuanVideo_1.5_repackaged`](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/HunyuanVideo_1.5_repackaged) & [`Comfy-Org/sigclip_vision_384`](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/sigclip_vision_384):\n\n| Folder | File | Size |\n|---|---|---:|\n| `models/diffusion_models/` | `hunyuanvideo1.5_480p_i2v_step_distilled_fp16.safetensors` | ~15.5 GB (~9 GB in FP8) |\n| `models/diffusion_models/` | *(optional 720p)* `hunyuanvideo1.5_720p_i2v_fp16.safetensors` | ~15.5 GB |\n| `models/text_encoders/` | `qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors` | ~8.7 GB |\n| `models/text_encoders/` | `byt5_small_glyphxl_fp16.safetensors` | ~0.4 GB |\n| `models/clip_vision/` | `sigclip_vision_patch14_384.safetensors` | ~0.8 GB |\n| `models/vae/` | `hunyuanvideo15_vae_fp16.safetensors` | ~2.3 GB |\n\n*100% native ComfyUI core nodes \u2014 no custom nodes required.*\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Model Downloads (HunyuanVideo 1.5 8.3B)\n\nFrom [`Comfy-Org/HunyuanVideo_1.5_repackaged`](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/HunyuanVideo_1.5_repackaged) & [`Comfy-Org/sigclip_vision_384`](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/sigclip_vision_384):\n\n| Folder | File | Size |\n|---|---|---:|\n| `models/diffusion_models/` | `hunyuanvideo1.5_480p_i2v_step_distilled_fp16.safetensors` | ~15.5 GB (~9 GB in FP8) |\n| `models/diffusion_models/` | *(optional 720p)* `hunyuanvideo1.5_720p_i2v_fp16.safetensors` | ~15.5 GB |\n| `models/text_encoders/` | `qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors` | ~8.7 GB |\n| `models/text_encoders/` | `byt5_small_glyphxl_fp16.safetensors` | ~0.4 GB |\n| `models/clip_vision/` | `sigclip_vision_patch14_384.safetensors` | ~0.8 GB |\n| `models/vae/` | `hunyuanvideo15_vae_fp16.safetensors` | ~2.3 GB |\n\n*100% native ComfyUI core nodes \u2014 no custom nodes required.*\n"
